{"verse_key": "10:87", "surah": 10, "verse": 87, "text_uthmani": "وَأَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَىٰ مُوسَىٰ وَأَخِيهِ أَن تَبَوَّءَا لِقَوْمِكُمَا بِمِصْرَ بُيُوتًا وَٱجْعَلُوا۟ بُيُوتَكُمْ قِبْلَةً وَأَقِيمُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ ۗ وَبَشِّرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "And We inspired to Moses and his brother, \"Settle your people in Egypt in houses and make your houses [facing the] qiblah<sup foot_note=196457>1</sup> and establish prayer and give good tidings to the believers.\"", "verse_from_ms": 1878800, "verse_to_ms": 1903150, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَأَوْحَيْنَآ", "start_ms": 1878800, "end_ms": 1882280}, {"i": 1, "text": "إِلَىٰ", "start_ms": 1882280, "end_ms": 1882870}, {"i": 2, "text": "مُوسَىٰ", "start_ms": 1882870, "end_ms": 1883640}, {"i": 3, "text": "وَأَخِيهِ", "start_ms": 1883640, "end_ms": 1884670}, {"i": 4, "text": "أَن", "start_ms": 1884670, "end_ms": 1885660}, {"i": 5, "text": "تَبَوَّءَا", "start_ms": 1885660, "end_ms": 1886790}, {"i": 6, "text": "لِقَوْمِكُمَا", "start_ms": 1886790, "end_ms": 1888170}, {"i": 7, "text": "بِمِصْرَ", "start_ms": 1888170, "end_ms": 1889090}, {"i": 8, "text": "بُيُوتًا", "start_ms": 1889090, "end_ms": 1890680}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَٱجْعَلُوا۟", "start_ms": 1890680, "end_ms": 1891700}, {"i": 10, "text": "بُيُوتَكُمْ", "start_ms": 1891700, "end_ms": 1892900}, {"i": 11, "text": "قِبْلَةً", "start_ms": 1892900, "end_ms": 1894380}, {"i": 12, "text": "وَأَقِيمُوا۟", "start_ms": 1894380, "end_ms": 1895260}, {"i": 13, "text": "ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ", "start_ms": 1895260, "end_ms": 1897970}, {"i": 14, "text": "ۗ", "start_ms": 1897970, "end_ms": 1899510}, {"i": 15, "text": "وَبَشِّرِ", "start_ms": 1899510, "end_ms": 1902605}, {"i": 16, "text": "ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}